otein sequences, functional annotations, transcriptomics, and spatial information rather than natural-language text. The abstract does not support a substantive text-bio bridge.","evidence_snippet":"“integrates protein sequences, functional annotations, transcriptomic profiles, and spatial information”"},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000109","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract presents a new ontology/framework for biology, but not a natural-language text model. References to human-readable formats and LLM auditing do not establish a substantive text component or text-bio bridge.","evidence_snippet":"“human-readable formats (FASTA, SBML, ontology triples)”; “maps ECO graphs into the residual stream of large language models”"},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000110","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a training-free GO clustering framework that leverages zero-shot semantic reasoning of existing LLMs. The abstract does not show a substantive natural-language text-bio model of its own.","evidence_snippet":"“leverages zero-shot semantic reasoning of LLMs”"},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000111","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The model is built on spatial transcriptomics but initializes nodes with frozen foundation-model representations, including existing text/sequence models. That is a wrapper-style multimodal predictor rather than a primary text-bio foundation model.","evide